{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "62d937fb-26c2-8b35-bf50-983ebd2a1fdb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:12:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Rui Resendes. I am calling because I have a question about a sign. Not a big sign, you understand. A small one for the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Like a sandwich board, an A-frame?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, the sandwich board. That is the word. I have a little shop front at the bottom of my building, and I would like to put one out in the morning. On the other hand, I do not know if the city lets me do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Are you on a public sidewalk or is it your own private property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk, I think. It is the, how you say, the cement part in front, before the street. Is that the public one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's between your building and the curb, it's most likely public sidewalk. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-nine Annandale Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So yes, a sandwich board out there generally needs a sign permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:09:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sign permit. Okay. And the size, is there a limit? Because I have one in mind that is, ah, about this tall, maybe the height of my hip. On the other hand, my neighbor says the board must be very small, like a pizza box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:09:17-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a size limit, but I don't want to hand you a number off the top of my head and have you build something the wrong size. The application will spell out the maximum height and width. Get that before you buy or make anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, so I should not buy first. That is wise. And the permit, it is the same as the permit for the big sign on the wall? Or is it a different paper?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:09:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Different. Wall signs and sidewalk signs are handled separately. Ask for the sign permit application and tell them it's for a sidewalk sandwich board."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sidewalk sandwich board. Yes. I write it down. [pause] And how long does the approval take? A week? A month? On the other hand, maybe it is one day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not one day, usually. It depends how complete your application is and who has to review it. Figure a couple of weeks, give or take. If something's missing, it takes longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of weeks. Okay. So if I put the board out tomorrow, while I wait, this would be a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:10:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, wait for the approval. Otherwise you could get a notice to take it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:10:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I do not want any trouble. My cousin just moved into the apartment upstairs, so I have a, how you say, a witness now. He will tell me if I make mistakes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:10:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to have. Does the building have an owner other than you? Sometimes the property owner has to sign off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The owner, hmm. I am the owner, I think, yes. But the apartment upstairs, is that a different owner? No, no, same. I am confused a little. The paper says my name and also my wife's name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then both names are probably on the deed, and that's fine. Just put the owner's name as it appears on your paperwork. If it's unclear, the application has a line for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. On the other hand, where do I get the application? I come to City Hall, or it is on the computer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either. You can stop by our counter during business hours, or look on the city website under zoning and inspections. If you can't find it, call back and we'll walk you through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The counter is good. I prefer paper. So, to repeat: sign permit, sidewalk sandwich board, size is on the form, and approval is about two weeks. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Bring a sketch of the board with the measurements, and where on the sidewalk it'll sit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Yes. I am not an artist, but I will try. Thank you, Mr. Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T14:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
